        "Description": "Agent 47, we have a new contract ordered by the same client one last time.\r\rHe has asked us to eliminate the targets who are supporters of the Anti-Furry. The client informed that the targets are trying to secure and steal the files that contains valuable informations and assets about the Furry Community. The client kindly ask us to eliminate these sleeper agents before the files are gone. Take them out and exit unseen.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare.",
